{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/extras/0576da4b0ead971563aa6430c69d2f94.poster.avif?t=1756567401\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/extras/0576da4b0ead971563aa6430c69d2f94.webm?t=1756567401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/extras/0576da4b0ead971563aa6430c69d2f94.mp4?t=1756567401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldat 2 recreates the classic experience of online deathmatch made famous by its predecessor, with the same physics-based movement, violence and guns. And much more . With a new stylized 2.5D look, ranked multiplayer, QoS improvements, customizations and new exciting weapons, maps and game modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/extras/f4d713c22e98ec6592e82930ae02462a.poster.avif?t=1756567401\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/extras/f4d713c22e98ec6592e82930ae02462a.webm?t=1756567401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/extras/f4d713c22e98ec6592e82930ae02462a.mp4?t=1756567401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can be played with bots!<br><br>For multiplayer, because the community is small<br>- it is recommended to join DISCORD and ask to play<br>- can be played with friends using Steam Friends invitations<br>- the game supports RANKED MULTIPLAYER match making (but please join Discord to see what time is best to play)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > iconic physics-based movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > online multiplayer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ranked/gather mode with player statistics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > capture the flag, team/deathmatch, <strong>domination</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > realistic weapons and military equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ragdoll physics and over the top violence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > singleplayer with bots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > lo-fi mode for clarity and/or potato pc's</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > customizations and configs for everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > built-in level editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > active development (more coming!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/extras/b59b423db2627f22e798f6b1791b3b93.poster.avif?t=1756567401\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/extras/b59b423db2627f22e798f6b1791b3b93.webm?t=1756567401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/extras/b59b423db2627f22e798f6b1791b3b93.mp4?t=1756567401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made (mostly) by one man, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the original creator of <strong>Soldat</strong>, <strong>King Arthur's Gold</strong> and producer of <strong>Butcher </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Michal 'MM' Marcinkowski</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/extras/aa4a2320992e8dde49e13d23919d2655.poster.avif?t=1756567401\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/extras/aa4a2320992e8dde49e13d23919d2655.webm?t=1756567401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/extras/aa4a2320992e8dde49e13d23919d2655.mp4?t=1756567401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/474220?t=1756567401","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756567401","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756567401","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756567401","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Join our community on Discord!</h1><p></p><br><h1>The original</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/474220/extras/0576da4b0ead971563aa6430c69d2f94.poster.avif?t=1756567401\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as